   <IntakeGate ready="!@interdisciplinary_1_completion_page.value">
    <Markdown> </Markdown>
    <!-- Input for student's causes -->
    <Vertical id="cause_inputs">
      <Markdown>
**Think of two causes for high school dropout:**
      </Markdown>
      <Markdown>**Your individual cause (internal):** Type a cause that focuses on an individual's choice or situation:</Markdown>
      <TextArea id="cause_internal" placeholder="e.g., Students who struggle with learning disabilities..." />
      <Markdown>**Your structural cause:** Type a cause that focuses on external factors beyond the individual:</Markdown>
      <TextArea id="cause_structural" placeholder="e.g., Schools in underfunded districts lack resources..." />
     </Vertical>
    </IntakeGate>

   <IntakeGate ready="!@interdisciplinary_1_completion_page.value">
    <Markdown> </Markdown>
    <!-- Combined list of causes from team + student -->
    <Vertical id="causes_list" popout="window">
      <Markdown>
**Combined Causes from Team Discussion:**

**Peggy's causes:**
- Students who have illnesses that make it hard for them to keep up with schoolwork
- Schools in rural communities can't accommodate students with physical disabilities

**Ty's causes:**
- Students who get involved with drugs or alcohol
- Family financial situations force students to work instead of studying

**Lacy's causes:**
- Students who don't see school as relevant to their future
- Schools lack counselors to help students navigate challenges

**Lianne's example:**
- Schools can't accommodate students with certain physical or mental disabilities (structural cause)

**Your causes:**
      </Markdown>
      <Ref target="cause_internal" />
      <Ref target="cause_structural" />
    </Vertical>
   </IntakeGate>
  </Vertical>

